# ─── Bot / notification pipeline (dev/) ────────────────────────────────────
# GH PAT for the dedicated automation account (claude-ai-milic). Never commit.
# Sample shape in userscripts/discogs_credits/DEVELOP.md > "How the bot logs in".
dev/.github-credentials.json

# Runtime state + audit logs for the GH-notification → MCP-channel pipeline.
# Each side (the PS poller and the Node MCP server) writes its own log so both
# halves are inspectable. Pure local runtime — never committed.
dev/.notification-state.json
dev/.notif-poll.log
dev/notif-channel/.channel.log
dev/notif-channel/node_modules/
